      "cooked": "<p>Yesterday morning, my daughter was practicing piano, and she played they hymn \"<a href=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/music/library/hymns/count-your-blessings?lang=eng\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Count Your Blessings</a>\".&nbsp; And I suddenly thought of \"Into the Stratosphere\" and started chuckling.&nbsp; The first line alone is golden, but there are some other great bits in there, too.&nbsp; I'll never hear that hymn the same way again, and I'll be referring to that card as \"Count Your Blessings\" from now on...<br>\n<br>\nThe only problem is how few people will appreciate this.&nbsp; I need a Venn diagram showing the overlap of people familiar with this hymn AND fans of SOTM...</p>",
